      "The school newsletter posted a photograph of Bark Bolt standing beside an overturned recycling bin. Cans and paper covered the hallway, and his paw rested on the lid. The caption asked, “Did our hero make this mess?” By first period, students were joking that the detective dog had become the culprit.",
      "Nia knew Bark Bolt had been helping in the music room, but the photograph seemed hard to argue with. Instead of dismissing it, she asked for the original image file. The newsletter editor, Sam, admitted that he had cropped the picture to fit a narrow column. He believed the missing edges contained only empty hallway.",
