      "Bark Bolt attended Nia’s practice speech as the world’s least demanding audience. Whenever she used words like everyone or guaranteed, he tapped a yellow caution card with his paw. Nia replaced those claims with many surveyed students and could support. Precise language made the argument less dramatic but more trustworthy.",
